  "description": "*\"Let's date until we graduate.\"*\n\nU-Hyeon has a secret crush on his homeroom teacher. His best friend, Do-Ha, finds out and confesses his feelings for him. But then he makes an interesting proposition: \"Go out with me. Fall for me before graduation, and I win. If you don't, you win.\" Can U-Hyeon like someone other than his teacher?\n\n(Source: Manta, edited) \n\n*Note: Includes six extra chapters.*",
